OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies in hospital after
OL,4,AHeadley car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has died from
OL,7,Finjuries he sustained in a car crash in
OL,8,Fwhich four other teenagers were
OL,9,Finjured.
OL,11,FThe five teenagers were in a Fiat Punto
OL,12,Fwhich hit a tree in Church Lane,
OL,13,FHeadley near Leatherhead at about 03:30
OL,14,FBST on Sunday,
OL,16,FThe man who died was a passenger in the
OL,17,Frear of the car, Surrey Police said.
OL,18,FTwo 18-year-old women and another
OL,19,F18-year-old man, also passengers in the
OL,20,Fcar, were seriously injured.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
