OL,3,GNEWSATeenager dies in hospital after
OL,4,AHeadley car crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver, also an 18-year-old man,
OL,7,Fwas treated for minor injuries and has
OL,8,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of driving
OL,9,Fwhile unfit through drink or drugs,
OL,10,Fdriving while over the limit and
OL,11,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,12,Fdriving.
